(7251626, 1126602, 124982, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Mark!! Are we going to get to see what the camera in the water took?</td>', 'Congrats, Mark!! Are we going to get to see what the camera in the water took?', '2014-08-15 08:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7251627, 1126602, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Garry:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, Mark!! Are we going to get to see what the camera in the water took? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>:)<br/>Nah, the camera on the tripod was just set up for this shot.  It was too windy that day so the water is too choppy. I''ll for sure be back though.  I noticed that my favorite boat is back, the one in the far background.  It''s been gone for about a year.</td>', 'Originally posted by Garry: Congrats, Mark!! Are we going to get to see what the camera in the water took?   :)Nah, the camera on the tripod was just set up for this shot.  It was too windy that day so the water is too choppy. I''ll for sure be back though.  I noticed that my favorite boat is back, the one in the far background.  It''s been gone for about a year.', '2014-08-15 08:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7251636, 1126725, 60581, '<td valign="top">A good capture for sure!</td>', 'A good capture for sure!', '2014-08-15 09:16:24.000000', NULL, 0),
