(7251673, 1126602, 60173, '<td valign="top">Do you ever have problems with your tripod sinking in the sand as the tide strolls in and out? That''s a problem I''ve had in the past when shooting from the water.</td>', 'Do you ever have problems with your tripod sinking in the sand as the tide strolls in and out? That''s a problem I''ve had in the past when shooting from the water.', '2014-08-15 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7251675, 1126602, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aliqui:</b></div><hr/><i> Do you ever have problems with your tripod sinking in the sand as the tide strolls in and out? That''s a problem I''ve had in the past when shooting from the water. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s never been a problem at this spot since the ground is a mixture of rock and sand and is pretty solid.  There isn''t that much movement in the water which also helps.  I have shot along shorelines that have some water movement that caused my tripod to sink though.</td>', 'Originally posted by aliqui: Do you ever have problems with your tripod sinking in the sand as the tide strolls in and out? That''s a problem I''ve had in the past when shooting from the water.   It''s never been a problem at this spot since the ground is a mixture of rock and sand and is pretty solid.  There isn''t that much movement in the water which also helps.  I have shot along shorelines that have some water movement that caused my tripod to sink though.', '2014-08-15 11:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7251684, 1126725, 38032, '<td valign="top">There have been several apps that encouraged this sort of behavior with an iPhone. They have been banned or don''t exist any more. Such a shame. GOod to see someone doing it with something <b><u>even more expensive!!! LOL</u></b> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.gizmodo.com.au/2009/07/hangtime-the-dumbest-iphone-app-of-all/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dumb app?! No way LOL</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-08-15 10:45:10.</i></td>', 'There have been several apps that encouraged this sort of behavior with an iPhone. They have been banned or don''t exist any more. Such a shame. GOod to see someone doing it with something even more expensive!!! LOL  dumb app?! No way LOL', '2014-08-15 11:44:52.000000', '2014-08-15 11:45:10.000000', 0),
